<title>CHILE: Chile Quinenco Q2 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile Quinenco Q2 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Quinenco SA, the holding company linked to the Luksic group, reported second quarter net earnings rising to 10.5 billion pesos from 2.6 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The increase was mainly the result of a rise in net income from the group's investments in financial holding company O'Higgins Centralhispanoamericano SA, copper products firm Madeco and  brewery Compania Cervecerias Unidas, said the group in a statement.</p>
</text>
